WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:06.817
Water, earth,

00:06.901 --> 00:10.195
fire, air...

00:11.322 --> 00:15.367
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.451 --> 00:18.745
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.789 --> 00:23.709
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.627
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.712 --> 00:27.004
he vanished.

00:27.422 --> 00:31.216
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.301 --> 00:32.884
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.262
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.346 --> 00:38.015
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.975 --> 00:42.269
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:14.552 --> 01:16.678
Nice try, Pupil Sangok.

01:16.763 --> 01:18.013
A couple of more years,

01:18.097 --> 01:20.349
and you might be ready
to fight a sea sponge.

01:22.518 --> 01:23.894
Whoa!

01:24.395 --> 01:27.314
Would anyone care for
a rematch with Katara?

01:29.650 --> 01:31.943
Katara, you've
advanced more quickly

01:32.028 --> 01:34.029
than any student I've ever trained.

01:34.113 --> 01:36.948
You have proven
that with fierce determination,

01:37.033 --> 01:38.784
passion, and hard work,

01:38.868 --> 01:40.994
you can accomplish anything.

01:41.537 --> 01:44.164
Raw talent alone is not enough.

01:44.248 --> 01:45.374
Pupil Aang!

01:45.458 --> 01:46.666
Yes, Master Pakku?

01:46.751 --> 01:49.336
Care to step into
the sparring circle?

01:49.420 --> 01:52.214
I figure since you've found time
to play with house pets,

01:52.298 --> 01:55.175
you must have
already mastered waterbending.

01:55.259 --> 01:56.802
I wouldn't say mastered,

01:56.886 --> 01:58.261
but check this out!

02:08.648 --> 02:10.982
So, they don't have palaces
in the Southern Tribe?

02:11.067 --> 02:12.234
Are you kidding?

02:12.318 --> 02:13.693
I grew up in a block of ice.

02:13.778 --> 02:15.737
It's not exactly a cultural hub.

02:18.825 --> 02:20.867
Sokka, this is wrong.

02:20.952 --> 02:22.035
What's wrong?

02:22.120 --> 02:23.495
We're taking a walk!

02:23.579 --> 02:24.830
I'm engaged.

02:24.914 --> 02:26.957
It just feels...

02:27.834 --> 02:29.167
I know what you need.

02:29.252 --> 02:30.877
You need to meet my good friend Appa.

02:30.962 --> 02:32.295
Who?

02:33.506 --> 02:35.632
Appa and I go way back,
don't we, boy?

02:35.716 --> 02:37.801
Aagh! Easy!

02:37.885 --> 02:38.927
Down, boy!

02:39.011 --> 02:40.053
No, up!

02:40.138 --> 02:43.014
Looks like you haven't been
giving Appa enough attention.

02:45.810 --> 02:47.352
So, how does this work?

02:47.437 --> 02:48.895
You hanging on tight?

02:50.314 --> 02:51.815
Yip, yip.

02:52.817 --> 02:55.026
My goodness!

02:56.863 --> 02:57.904
Wow!

02:57.989 --> 03:00.824
I can't believe you do this every day.

03:00.908 --> 03:03.285
Yeah, we pretty much live up here.

03:03.369 --> 03:06.079
Is it always this cold in the sky?

03:07.081 --> 03:08.707
Not when you're with someone.

03:10.251 --> 03:11.877
It's beautiful up here.

03:11.961 --> 03:13.003
Yeah.

03:17.508 --> 03:18.925
Whoo, yeah!

03:20.428 --> 03:22.137
Good times, good times.

03:23.514 --> 03:24.598
Hey, look.

03:25.558 --> 03:26.808
What's happening?

03:28.019 --> 03:29.227
No.

03:53.336 --> 03:54.920
- Soot.
- What?

03:55.004 --> 03:56.505
I've seen it before.

03:56.589 --> 03:58.423
Right before my village was attacked.

03:58.508 --> 04:00.425
It's soot mixed with snow.

04:00.510 --> 04:01.593
But why?

04:01.677 --> 04:03.345
It's the Fire Nation.

04:03.429 --> 04:05.222
They've closed in on the North Pole.

04:05.306 --> 04:06.973
And from the looks of this stuff,

04:07.058 --> 04:09.059
I'd say there's a lot of them.

04:12.730 --> 04:16.483
This will truly be one for
the history books, General Iroh.

04:16.567 --> 04:19.110
Just think. Centuries from now,

04:19.195 --> 04:21.321
people will study
the Great Admiral Zhao,

04:21.405 --> 04:22.656
who destroyed the last

04:22.740 --> 04:24.908
of the Water Tribe civilization.

04:25.243 --> 04:27.118
You're lucky you're here to see it.

04:27.203 --> 04:30.038
Be careful what you wish for, Admiral.

04:30.122 --> 04:33.291
History is not always kind
to its subjects.

04:33.376 --> 04:36.169
I suppose you speak from experience.

04:36.254 --> 04:39.172
But, rest assured,
this will be nothing like

04:39.257 --> 04:42.676
your legendary failure at Ba Sing Se.

04:42.760 --> 04:45.095
I hope not, for your sake.

04:45.179 --> 04:48.306
Tell the captains to prepare
for first strike.

04:56.232 --> 04:58.024
We'll be landing soon.

04:58.109 --> 04:59.609
Do you have a plan?

04:59.694 --> 05:01.152
I'm working on it, Uncle.

05:11.706 --> 05:13.456
What's wrong? We have to go!

05:13.541 --> 05:14.583
No, Sokka.

05:14.667 --> 05:15.709
Wait.

05:15.793 --> 05:17.335
I can't see you anymore.

05:17.420 --> 05:18.461
Not at all.

05:18.546 --> 05:20.338
What? We're just friends.

05:20.423 --> 05:22.632
I wish we could just be friends.

05:22.717 --> 05:24.217
But I like you too much,

05:24.302 --> 05:26.636
and it's too confusing
to be around you.

05:26.721 --> 05:28.763
I'm marrying someone else.

05:28.973 --> 05:31.349
You don't love him, do you?

05:31.434 --> 05:33.268
You don't even seem to like him.

05:33.352 --> 05:35.020
But I do love my people.

05:35.104 --> 05:37.439
You're not marrying them!

05:37.523 --> 05:39.274
You don't understand.

05:39.358 --> 05:40.942
I have duties to my father,

05:41.027 --> 05:42.235
to my tribe.

05:42.320 --> 05:43.737
I have to do this.

05:43.821 --> 05:45.113
Good-bye.

05:48.117 --> 05:51.494
The day we have feared
for so long has arrived.

05:51.579 --> 05:54.581
The Fire Nation is on our doorstep.

05:54.665 --> 05:57.208
It is with great sadness

05:57.293 --> 06:00.003
I call my family here before me,

06:00.087 --> 06:03.214
knowing well that some of these faces

06:03.299 --> 06:06.301
are about to vanish from our tribe.

06:07.261 --> 06:10.764
But they will never vanish
from our hearts.

06:11.140 --> 06:14.851
Now, as we approach
the battle for our existence,

06:14.935 --> 06:18.063
I call upon the great spirits.

06:19.315 --> 06:21.149
Spirit of the ocean,

06:21.233 --> 06:24.944
spirit of the moon, be with us!

06:25.029 --> 06:29.074
I'm going to need volunteers
for a dangerous mission.

06:29.492 --> 06:31.534
-Count me in.
-Sokka...

06:31.619 --> 06:32.994
Be warned.

06:33.079 --> 06:35.747
Many of you will not return.

06:35.831 --> 06:37.749
Come forward to receive my mark

06:37.833 --> 06:40.335
if you accept the task.

07:07.321 --> 07:10.156
The stillness before battle
is unbearable.

07:10.241 --> 07:12.742
Such a quiet dread.

07:12.827 --> 07:15.745
I wasn't there when the Fire Nation
attacked my people.

07:16.414 --> 07:18.540
I'm gonna make a difference this time.

08:04.545 --> 08:05.628
Yip, yip!

08:10.593 --> 08:11.843
Katara!

08:34.700 --> 08:36.075
I'll take it from here, boy.

09:46.063 --> 09:47.272
Appa!

09:50.818 --> 09:52.277
Thanks for the rescue, buddy.

10:13.966 --> 10:15.800
You've gotta be kidding me.

10:18.387 --> 10:21.890
Men, you'll be infiltrating
the Fire Nation navy.

10:22.224 --> 10:26.185
That means you'll all need
one of these uniforms.

10:31.692 --> 10:33.234
What's your problem?

10:33.319 --> 10:35.778
Fire navy uniforms
don't look like that.

10:35.863 --> 10:37.488
Of course they do.

10:37.573 --> 10:41.075
These are real uniforms captured
from actual fire navy soldiers.

10:41.368 --> 10:43.620
When, like, 100 years ago?

10:44.079 --> 10:45.455
85.

10:45.539 --> 10:47.874
The Fire Nation doesn't wear
shoulder spikes anymore.

10:47.958 --> 10:51.044
The newer uniforms
are more streamlined.

10:51.128 --> 10:52.962
How do we know we can trust this guy?

10:53.047 --> 10:55.548
Such bold talk for a new recruit.

10:55.633 --> 10:57.759
Sokka is from our sister tribe, Hahn.

10:57.843 --> 11:02.096
He is a capable warrior,
and I value his input.

11:02.431 --> 11:05.224
Now, our first objective
is to determine

11:05.309 --> 11:08.144
the identity
of their commanding officer.

11:08.520 --> 11:09.938
His name is Zhao.

11:10.856 --> 11:13.608
Middle-aged, big sideburns,
bigger temper...

11:13.984 --> 11:17.737
Sokka, I want you to tell
everything you know to Hahn.

11:17.821 --> 11:19.614
He's leading this mission.

11:19.698 --> 11:21.908
Hahn, show Sokka your respect.

11:21.992 --> 11:25.703
I expect nothing less
from my future son-in-law.

11:28.165 --> 11:29.916
Princess Yue's marrying you?

11:30.000 --> 11:31.584
Yeah. What of it?

11:31.669 --> 11:33.795
Nothing. Congratulations.

11:40.427 --> 11:42.178
Stop those fireballs!

11:51.563 --> 11:53.481
It's almost twilight, Admiral.

11:53.565 --> 11:54.857
As your military consultant,

11:54.942 --> 11:57.694
I must advise you to halt your attack.

11:57.778 --> 12:00.780
The waterbenders draw their power
from the moon,

12:00.864 --> 12:02.949
and it is nearly full tonight.

12:03.033 --> 12:06.160
You should wait
and resume the attack at daybreak.

12:06.245 --> 12:08.246
I am well aware
of the moon problem.

12:08.330 --> 12:11.124
And I'm working on a solution.

12:11.208 --> 12:13.793
But for now, daybreak it is.

12:20.843 --> 12:22.468
They've stopped firing.

12:22.553 --> 12:23.594
Aang!

12:29.810 --> 12:32.895
I can't do it.

12:32.980 --> 12:34.313
What happened?

12:34.398 --> 12:36.774
I must have taken out
a dozen fire navy ships,

12:36.859 --> 12:39.569
but there's just too many of them.

12:39.653 --> 12:41.195
I can't fight them all!

12:41.280 --> 12:43.072
But you have to.

12:43.157 --> 12:44.574
You're the Avatar.

12:44.658 --> 12:46.659
I'm just one kid.

12:56.462 --> 12:58.755
If you are fishing
for an octopus, my nephew,

12:58.839 --> 13:01.257
you need a tightly woven net,

13:01.341 --> 13:05.053
or he will squeeze through
the tiniest hole and escape.

13:05.137 --> 13:07.138
I don't need your wisdom
right now, Uncle.

13:07.222 --> 13:10.641
I'm sorry, I just nag you because...

13:10.726 --> 13:14.062
Well, ever since I lost my son...

13:14.521 --> 13:16.939
Uncle, you don't have to say it.

13:17.024 --> 13:19.484
I think of you as my own.

13:21.695 --> 13:23.112
I know, Uncle.

13:23.197 --> 13:24.363
We'll meet again.

13:26.158 --> 13:27.992
After I have the Avatar.

13:30.996 --> 13:33.122
Remember your breath of fire.

13:33.207 --> 13:34.791
It could save your life out there.

13:34.875 --> 13:35.917
I will.

13:36.001 --> 13:37.835
And put your hood up.

13:37.920 --> 13:39.629
Keep your ears warm.

13:39.713 --> 13:41.005
I'll be fine!

13:49.515 --> 13:50.932
Let me tell you, Sokka,

13:51.016 --> 13:54.185
I've courted a lot of girls,
but Yue is the finest.

13:54.269 --> 13:56.270
And she comes with the most perks.

13:56.355 --> 13:58.606
Perks?! What does that mean?

13:58.690 --> 14:00.983
I mean,
Yue's nice and everything,

14:01.068 --> 14:03.152
but the points I'll gain
with the chief aren't bad either.

14:03.237 --> 14:06.864
Princess Yue is wasted
on a self-absorbed weasel like you!

14:07.241 --> 14:08.574
Whoa, hang on!

14:08.659 --> 14:09.826
What do you care?

14:09.910 --> 14:12.328
You're just a simple rube
from the Southern Tribe.

14:12.412 --> 14:15.414
What would you know of the political
complexities of our life?

14:15.499 --> 14:16.707
No offense.

14:20.504 --> 14:23.256
You're just a jerk without a soul!
No offense!

14:25.843 --> 14:27.176
That's enough!

14:27.261 --> 14:29.929
Sokka, you're off the mission.

14:30.556 --> 14:32.306
All right, fall in, men!

14:32.391 --> 14:34.183
Everybody listen to what I say,

14:34.268 --> 14:37.270
and we'll take out this Admiral Cho
in no time!

14:37.354 --> 14:39.147
It's Admiral Zhao!

15:15.100 --> 15:16.767
Where are they going?

15:18.687 --> 15:20.855
They're coming up for air somewhere.

15:30.032 --> 15:33.117
The legends say the moon
was the first waterbender.

15:33.202 --> 15:35.786
Our ancestors saw how it pushed
and pulled the tides,

15:35.871 --> 15:37.788
and learned how to do it themselves.

15:37.873 --> 15:41.292
I've always noticed
my waterbending is stronger at night.

15:41.376 --> 15:44.253
Our strength comes from
the spirit of the moon,

15:44.338 --> 15:46.714
our life comes from the spirit
of the ocean.

15:46.798 --> 15:49.383
They work together to keep balance.

15:49.593 --> 15:50.843
The spirits.

15:50.928 --> 15:53.679
Maybe I can find them
and get their help.

15:53.764 --> 15:55.139
How can you do that?

15:55.224 --> 15:56.766
The avatar is the bridge

15:56.850 --> 15:58.851
between our world
and the spirit world.

15:58.936 --> 16:00.311
Aang can talk to them!

16:00.395 --> 16:03.356
Maybe they'll give you the wisdom
to win this battle.

16:03.440 --> 16:04.899
Or maybe they'll unleash

16:05.025 --> 16:07.485
a crazy-amazing spirit attack
on the Fire Nation!

16:09.529 --> 16:11.197
Or wisdom. That's good, too.

16:11.281 --> 16:12.990
The only problem is,

16:13.075 --> 16:15.493
the last time you got
to the spirit world by accident.

16:15.577 --> 16:17.286
How are you going
to get there this time?

16:17.371 --> 16:19.622
I have an idea. Follow me.

16:26.505 --> 16:28.464
So, is this the way
to the spirit world?

16:28.548 --> 16:29.632
Ha ha ha. No.

16:29.716 --> 16:32.593
You'll have to get there on your own.
But I can take you

16:32.678 --> 16:35.846
to the most spiritual place
in the entire North Pole.

16:52.698 --> 16:55.616
I never thought
I'd miss grass this much!

16:55.701 --> 16:58.494
It's so warm here!
How is that possible?

16:58.578 --> 17:01.872
It's the center
of all spiritual energy in our land.

17:11.300 --> 17:12.800
You're right, Yue.

17:12.884 --> 17:14.468
I can feel...

17:14.553 --> 17:15.636
Something.

17:15.721 --> 17:16.929
It's so...

17:17.014 --> 17:18.431
Tranquil.

17:36.283 --> 17:37.325
Be quiet!

17:57.512 --> 17:59.513
Is something wrong, Sokka?

17:59.598 --> 18:00.723
No.

18:00.807 --> 18:02.391
Hahn's out there
on the top-secret mission,

18:02.476 --> 18:04.352
while I'm here
sharpening my boomerang.

18:04.436 --> 18:05.728
Everything's fine.

18:05.812 --> 18:07.271
Listen to me.

18:07.356 --> 18:10.066
I took you off the mission
for selfish reasons.

18:10.150 --> 18:13.152
I have a special task in mind for you.

18:13.236 --> 18:14.945
What, you want me
to scrub the barracks?

18:15.030 --> 18:18.908
I want you to guard my daughter,
Princess Yue.

18:19.451 --> 18:21.327
Sure.

18:21.411 --> 18:23.204
That shouldn't be too hard.

19:16.216 --> 19:18.175
Why is he sitting like that?

19:18.260 --> 19:19.552
He's meditating.

19:19.636 --> 19:21.846
Trying to cross over
into the spirit world.

19:22.139 --> 19:24.098
It takes all his concentration.

19:24.516 --> 19:26.225
Is there any way we can help?

19:26.309 --> 19:27.977
How about some quiet?!

19:28.061 --> 19:31.188
Come on, guys,
I can hear every word you're saying.

19:51.710 --> 19:52.793
Is he ok?

19:52.878 --> 19:54.670
He's crossing into the spirit world.

19:54.754 --> 19:57.131
He'll be fine as long as
we don't move his body.

19:57.215 --> 19:59.550
That's his way back
to the physical world.

19:59.634 --> 20:00.968
Maybe we should get some help?

20:01.052 --> 20:02.595
No. He's my friend.

20:02.679 --> 20:04.972
I'm perfectly capable
of protecting him.

20:05.348 --> 20:08.267
Well, aren't you a big girl now?

20:08.351 --> 20:09.393
No...

20:09.478 --> 20:10.519
Yes.

20:10.604 --> 20:13.063
Hand him over
and I won't have to hurt you.

20:15.817 --> 20:16.984
Hyah!

20:24.951 --> 20:26.619
I see you've learned a new trick.

20:26.703 --> 20:28.579
But I didn't come this far
to lose to you.

20:48.808 --> 20:50.893
You little peasant.

20:50.977 --> 20:53.020
You've found a master, haven't you?

20:56.566 --> 20:58.025
Hyah!

21:03.114 --> 21:04.532
Hyah! Hyah...

21:09.329 --> 21:11.330
Aah! Uh!

21:12.082 --> 21:13.916
Hyah! Hyah...

21:27.097 --> 21:29.348
It's daybreak at last.

21:29.724 --> 21:31.725
Let's write history.

21:53.582 --> 21:57.418
You rise with the moon,
I rise with the sun.

22:08.888 --> 22:12.516
The Water Tribe can try
to resist the inevitable,

22:13.310 --> 22:15.853
but their city will fall today.

22:23.236 --> 22:25.029
Aang?!

22:26.906 --> 22:28.824
What happened?! Where's Zuko?!

22:28.908 --> 22:30.034
He took Aang.

22:30.118 --> 22:32.453
He took him right out from under me.

22:33.121 --> 22:34.913
Where did they go?
